;; Wire: input names at 0x200; descriptors 0x100; rings 0x1000/0x2000; handles 0x3000;
;; prior-batch ordinal map 0x4000; config 0x4400; trace work 0x5000; per-act payloads 0x8000;
;; literals 0xc000. All arithmetic and wire values are integers, fixed values are Q48.16 raw bits.
